          "type": "Type",
          "_label": "descriptive note"
        }
      ],
      "content": "bed-hangings: curtains and other cloth hangings on or around a bed, used for decoration, privacy, and control of light and draughts (Getty AAT). Recorded in many materials (worsted, serge, tapestry, verdure, arras, buckram), single or double / lined, embroidered, with celures, testers and curtains, and by place of manufacture (Winchester, Norfolk, York, Ghent, Flanders, Oudenarde). Latin lectus (a 'bed', i.e. a bed with its hangings)."
    }
  ],
